### Create user
POST http://localhost:8000/createuser
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpass123",
  "first_name": "Test",
  "last_name": "User"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testuser",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Me
GET http://localhost:8000/me
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### List projects
GET http://localhost:8000/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Create project
POST http://localhost:8000/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo project"
}

### Get one project (poné un ID válido)
GET http://localhost:8000/projects/{{PROJECT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Rename project
PATCH http://localhost:8000/projects/{{PROJECT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nuevo nombre"
}

### Delete project
DELETE http://localhost:8000/projects/{{PROJECT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
